{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/568887-need-help-finding-out-the-type-of-an-infrastructure","id":568887,"title":"Need help finding out the type of an infrastructure","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-26T00:27:44-07:00","id":568887,"title":"Need help finding out the type of an infrastructure","content":"For an adventure I have a special sort of infrastructure in mind. A ship. This ship is there to store souls for further usage.<br /> Now if the ship is moving around transporting them to where they are needed for processing it is clearly a transportation infrastructure.<br /> <br /> BUT what is if the ship is just thre to STORE them and not to move them around just a sole storage. What type of infrastructure could that be?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-26T00:43:28-07:00","id":568917,"title":"","content":"It's still Logistical Infrastructure, seeing as it's a cache of materials that will ostensibly serve as a waypoint for whatever agents the Machine applies to the task of putting those souls to use.<br /> <br /> Failing that, it's Concealment Infrastructure meant to cover up &quot;there are a bunch of souls in this location&quot; with &quot;there is a boat in this location.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-26T00:47:10-07:00","id":568919,"title":"","content":"Ah nice. Wasnt sure if non moving could still be logistical.<br /> <br /> Hmmm how about that part of the ship (most part) is logistical while an artifact on the bridge serves as concealment (hiding it from radar) and the hull as concealment for the souls and the real state of the ship.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}